## Artifacts

| Phase | Write | Gate |
|---|---|---|
| spec | `spec/spec.md` | acceptance is testable |
| build | code and tests | build checks pass |
| verify | `verify/evidence.md` | tests and review pass |
| ship | `release/release.json` | probe matches |
| learn | `wiki/progress/retro.md` | archived and docs updated |

## Rules

- Do not write business code before the spec gate passes.
- Do not ship before verification passes.
- Branch and deploy state changes touch `wiki/progress/` only; `wiki/knowledge/` does not move.
- Never commit `.agents/` or `out/`.
- Never put secret values in `galadon.yaml` or git.
- Fail loud: no silent fallback, no partial-success claim.

## Commands

```bash
galadon next
galadon check
galadon ship --env test --dry-run
```
